message:
Rename the following section into Leadership & Roles and portray it as a seperate section Network
Active Commands
@RewardsRealm
Owner
@SMPHub
Owner
@MineGift
Executive

You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer.

I have an existing portfolio website. I want you to **redesign it completely while preserving all the content and functionality from the original code provided below**.

Your task is to create a **professional, futuristic, premium-looking portfolio website inspired by Nothing’s design language**.

IMPORTANT:

* Use the **existing content, sections, and information from the provided code**.
* Completely **redesign the UI/UX**.
* Make the site look **modern, futuristic, and highly polished**.

DESIGN STYLE (Nothing Inspired)

* Pure black background
* White and soft grey typography
* Minimal design
* Subtle dot/grid texture backgrounds
* Thin borders
* Smooth glowing accents
* Clean spacing
* Smooth micro-interactions
* Soft glassmorphism where appropriate
* Elegant hover effects

Typography:
Use modern fonts such as:

* Inter
* Space Mono
* Syne

UI FEATURES
Include modern UI features such as:

* Smooth scroll animations
* Glow hover effects
* Card lift animations
* Spotlight hover effect
* Scroll progress indicator
* Subtle animated background elements
* Smooth section transitions

STRUCTURE

Header / Navbar

* Sticky futuristic navigation bar
* Logo with profile image
* Navigation links for all sections
* Animated underline hover effect
* Minimal CTA button

Hero Section

* Large hero card
* Profile image
* Name: Aditya Mishra
* Tagline introducing the portfolio
* Two CTA buttons
* Futuristic glowing accents

About Section

* Keep the introduction content from the code
* Display tech stack in a modern grid of badges

Projects Section

* Modern project cards
* Each card should contain:

  * Project name
  * Description
  * Feature list
  * Tags
  * CTA button
* Add hover animations
* Optional project gallery modal

REMOVE THIS SECTION COMPLETELY:
Communities / Servers

Experience / Features Section
Keep the skills and experience content but present them as modern animated feature cards.

Roles / Services Section
Keep all roles but redesign the cards to look more futuristic and minimal.

Collaborators Section
Create a modern collaborator grid.

Each collaborator card must contain:

* Profile image
* Name
* Description

If an image is a GIF, use a **single stable frame**.

Testimonials Section
Display testimonials in modern glass cards with quotes and author details.

Contact Section
Simple call-to-action section with:

* Email button
* Discord button
* Social links

Footer
Minimal futuristic footer including:

* Navigation links
* Social buttons
* Copyright text

ANIMATION STYLE
Use smooth animations such as:

* Fade-up animations
* Soft glow hover effects
* Floating UI elements
* Smooth button ripple effect

TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS

* Output a **single complete HTML file**
* Use **clean and well-structured HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript**
* Do **not use frameworks**
* Fully responsive for mobile and desktop
* Optimize performance

IMPORTANT
Use the **content from the existing website code below**, but redesign the entire UI to be **modern, futuristic, and inspired by Nothing's design system**.

Here is the original website code to redesign:

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Aditya Mishra • Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="./adi.jpg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #000000;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #ffffff;
      --muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      --glass-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --accent: #ffffff;
      --accent-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      --purple-accent: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    * {
      cursor: default;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    html, body {
      height: 100%;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 10px;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }

    ::selection {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--black);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 420px at 18% 8%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 62%),
        radial-gradient(900px 420px at 82% 92%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 0%, transparent 62%),
        radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, transparent 80%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      animation: bgShift 25s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    body::after {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 400px;
      height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) 30%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      filter: blur(60px);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    body.mouse-active::after {
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    @keyframes bgShift {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 1.1; }
    }

    main {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    a, a:visited {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    section {
      scroll-margin-top: 120px;
    }

    /* Target specific IDs to be more specific than general section tag */
    #about, #communities, #hiring, #roles, #contact, #collaborators, #testimonials, #cta-ready {
      scroll-margin-top: 140px;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(180%);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      animation: headerSlideDown 0.6s ease-out;
    }

    @keyframes headerSlideDown {
      from {
        transform: translateY(-100%);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      to {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--white);
      animation: brandSlideIn 0.8s ease-out 0.1s backwards;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .brand:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    @keyframes brandSlideIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateX(-30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(0);
      }
    }

    .brand-text {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 1;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      animation: textGlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes textGlow {
      0%, 100% {
        filter: brightness(1);
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      50% {
        filter: brightness(1.2);
        letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      }
    }

    .brand:hover .brand-text {
      opacity: 1;
      animation: textGlowIntense 0.6s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes textGlowIntense {
      0%, 100% { filter: brightness(1); }
      50% { filter: brightness(1.3); }
    }

    .logo-diamond {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--accent-glow);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      animation: profileRotate 8s linear infinite;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .logo-diamond img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      animation: profileSpin 8s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes profileRotate {
      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    @keyframes profileSpin {
      0% { filter: brightness(1); }
      50% { filter: brightness(1.2); }
      100% { filter: brightness(1); }
    }

    .brand:hover .logo-diamond {
      animation: profileRotateFast 3s linear infinite;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }

    @keyframes profileRotateFast {
      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .logo-diamond.large {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      animation: imagePulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
      border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .logo-diamond.large img {
      animation: none;
    }

    @keyframes imagePulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--accent-glow); }
    }

    .site-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      justify-content: center;
      animation: navSlideIn 0.8s ease-out 0.2s backwards;
    }

    @keyframes navSlideIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .site-nav a {
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      animation: navLinkFadeIn 0.6s ease-out backwards;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .site-nav a:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.55s; }
    .site-nav a:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

    @keyframes navLinkFadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-10px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .site-nav a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -2px;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), transparent);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .site-nav a:hover {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .site-nav a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .header-cta {
      justify-self: end;
      animation: ctaSlideIn 0.8s ease-out 0.3s backwards;
    }

    .header-cta .btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header-cta .btn::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
      transition: left 0.5s ease;
    }

    .header-cta .btn:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1));
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .header-cta .btn:hover::before {
      left: 100%;
    }

    @keyframes ctaSlideIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateX(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(0);
      }
    }

    .header-cta .btn {
      position: relative;
      animation: btnPulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes btnPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      }
      50% {
        box-shadow: 0 16px 48px -8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
      }
    }

    .header-cta .btn:hover {
      animation: none;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 32px;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    main {
      display: grid;
      gap: 100px;
      padding: 80px 0 120px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
      min-height: 80vh;
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .about .glass {
      animation: glassSlideUp 0.7s ease-out 0.1s backwards;
    }

    @keyframes glassSlideUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(40px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .contact .glass {
      animation: glassSlideUp 0.7s ease-out 0.1s backwards;
    }

    .hero-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 64px 48px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 900px;
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
      border-radius: 30px;
      animation: heroCardFade 0.8s ease-out 0.2s backwards;
    }

    @keyframes heroCardFade {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.95);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }

    .hero-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 32px 100px -28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .hero-card h1 {
      font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      font-size: clamp(44px, 9vw, 76px);
      animation: titleFade 0.8s ease-out 0.3s backwards;
    }

    @keyframes titleFade {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .tagline {
      animation: titleFade 0.8s ease-out 0.5s backwards;
    }

    .cta {
      animation: titleFade 0.8s ease-out 0.7s backwards;
    }

    .glass {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(180%);
      box-shadow:
        0 24px 80px -24px var(--shadow),
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .glass:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      box-shadow:
        0 32px 100px -28px var(--shadow),
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      color: var(--white);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .btn::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transition: width 0.6s, height 0.6s;
    }

    .btn:hover::before {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px -12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .btn.primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .btn.primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
      box-shadow: 0 24px 56px -8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }

    .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .about, .projects, .communities, .hiring, .roles, .team, .contact {
      scroll-margin-top: 80px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .about .glass {
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    }

    .about p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .about h2, .projects h2, .communities h2, .hiring h2, .roles h2, .collaborators h2, .contact h2, .testimonials h2 {
      font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      margin: 0 0 40px;
      color: var(--white);
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .about h2::after, .projects h2::after, .communities h2::after, .hiring h2::after, .roles h2::after, .contact h2::after, .testimonials h2::after, .collaborators h2::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -12px;
      left: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6), transparent);
      width: 80px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .experience h2::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -8px;
      left: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), transparent);
      width: 60px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .projects h2 {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .project-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .gallery-item {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      animation: galleryItemZoom 0.7s ease-out backwards;
    }

    @keyframes galleryItemZoom {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(0.5) rotate(-10deg);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);
      }
    }

    .gallery-item:hover {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      transform: scale(1.08) rotate(2deg);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .gallery-item img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .gallery-item:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .gallery-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .gallery-item:hover .gallery-overlay {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .gallery-overlay span {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .modal {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 200;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }

    .modal.active {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    .modal-content {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 90%;
      max-height: 90%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
